    "description": "SHIKIGAKU. Co., Ltd. provides management and organization consulting services in Japan. It operates through Organizational Consulting Business, Sports Entertainment Business, Consulting Business, Sports Entertainment Business, and Fund Business segments. The company offers management, marketing, and recruitment consulting; and hands-on support program. It also operates an investment business; HYO-SHIKI, a community for business professionals that delivers content; and Fukushima Firebonds, a professional basketball team. In addition, the company provides Shikigaku basic, hierarchical training for HR professionals, Shikigaku Fund, basic, and recruitment consulting services. Further, it engages in venture capital business; development and provision of web services; publication of books; and provision of employee training services. It serves executive, representative of a non-profit organization and professional services firm, head of government office, sports coach, managers, team members, students who are about to enter the workforce, sole proprietor, and athletes. The company was incorporated in 2015 and is headquartered in Shinagawa, Japan."
